&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;タイに空調機の設計・開発子会社Fujitsu General Engineering (Thailand) Co.,Ltd.を設立&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（2020年１月、Fujitsu General Air Conditioning R&amp;amp;D (Thailand) Co., Ltd.に改称）&lt;/p&gt;
